id: pm-beads-i59r
title: Reconcile Beads snapshots against an acknowledged base and live tracker
description: "Acceptance: concurrent local and external edits conflict deterministically; external omissions only propose deletion and never delete by default; stale-base application refuses. Deliver typed SDK and CLI, compact TOON/JSON reports, typed remedies, README/example, non-git public tracker validation and npm/Bun CI release gates."
type: Feature
status: in_progress
priority: 2
tags: []
created_at: "2026-10-21T20:31:04.869Z"
updated_at: "2026-10-21T21:02:52.759Z"
author: codex-agent
comments[8]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-10-21T20:31:26.295Z",codex-agent,"Overlap recheck: pm-beads import --upsert strategies update/skip/fail and beads diff compare incoming/live data without an acknowledged external base. Core bulk keyed upsert likewise lacks external base ownership. Jira import uses SDK transactions and ADO owns remote revision assertions; their provider reconciliation stays in those adapters. This feature owns only Beads snapshot acknowledgement and three-way field classification, reusing core item versions and workspace transactions. Tracker-only PR #159 and its eight items are excluded."
  "2026-10-21T20:39:13.625Z",codex-agent,"Implemented source-scoped acknowledged bases, pure field-level three-way plans, bounded summaries and SDK/CLI preview/apply workflows. Real non-git tracker tests verify disjoint merges, conflicts, persistent omission proposals, stale-base and stale-tracker refusal. Application uses core history hashes and workspace journals; new identities are created before relationship wiring. Targeted failure testing caught and corrected SDK dependency flag syntax and empty-edge clearing requirements. Full release coverage remains assigned to CI because the host is saturated."
  "2026-10-21T20:46:49.139Z",codex-agent,"Expanded overlap check: pm-todos sync rewrites its current checkbox file after import/export, while CSV transaction imports and Linear/GitHub sync retain adapter-specific contracts; none supplies an acknowledged Beads external base. Added real SDK rollback, exact journal replay, writer-lock revalidation and git-free PATH regressions. Core explicit-unset audit suffixes are now recognized when inspecting transaction markers. CI now executes the unchanged full release:check script under npm and Bun on Node 22 and 26."
  "2026-10-21T20:49:22.744Z",codex-agent,"Public-data proof: archived public main tracker at 104ee0d795b6d9b5c305686209d8ab1c6b540bc7 into a fresh non-git tracker. 93 baseline items; 93 unchanged. A 93-record incoming snapshot plus synthetic concurrent edits yielded 1 deterministic field conflict. Conflict-free variant applied 2 changes, preserved 2 local-only edits and 1 deletion proposal; item count became 94. Conflict, stale-base and stale-tracker refusals passed. Original public tracker tree remained unchanged. Compact JSON was 773 bytes versus 135695 bytes for the full review plan; elapsed 6.36 seconds. Reproducible command: node test/public-reconcile-validation.ts."
  "2026-10-21T20:54:25.896Z",codex-agent,"Behavioral revert proof: reverting only the classifier to unconditional upsert made the truth-table regression fail (1 failure); suppressing omission proposals made the real non-git regression fail (0 versus 1 proposal); reverting the apply function to trust the preview without base validation/reclassification made the stale-base regression fail with Missing expected rejection. Restored the implementation after every experiment. New reconciliation source measured 100% lines, branches and functions in targeted coverage. Real compiled CLI also passed acknowledgement, JSON/TOON preview, apply and stale refusal with git absent from PATH. Raised only the declared compatible host floor to the already-pinned 2026.10.15 SDK; no development dependency was upgraded."
  "2026-10-21T20:57:29.456Z",codex-agent,"Final validation includes 22 reconciliation regressions and 8 compiled CLI/packaging/flag checks, typecheck, test typecheck, source docstring lint and public-copy validation. The real CLI accepts flags before the snapshot argument and emits compact TOON/JSON with git absent. Aggregate core compensation failures now return a typed recovery_required refusal with a remedy, preserving later writes. No separate lint script is configured; the maintained source/docstring gate and whitespace validation are used. Full npm/Bun release gates remain on CI."
  "2026-10-21T20:58:42.931Z",codex-agent,"All six linked commands passed: 22 reconciliation tests, 8 compiled CLI/packaging/flag checks, typecheck, test typecheck, docstring lint and the 93-item public-copy validation. Local strict health separately reports environment host skew from an already-installed extension and bootstrap fence drift; this does not establish a fresh-checkout CI verdict, which remains required. Existing tracker-reconciliation items and merge-driver files are untouched."
  "2026-10-21T21:02:51.457Z",codex-agent,"Initial full CI passed at 881d156: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-beads/actions/runs/39675043717 . Both npm run release:check and bun run release:check passed on Node 22 and 26, 377/377 tests per gate, zero failures/skips, 9 measured source files at 100% lines/branches/functions. A final real-clock regression then exposed ambiguous timestamp rollback; compensation now uses exact core history versions, and legacy checkpoints without a version mapping refuse before writing. Reverting only this compensation fix fails its shared-timestamp assertion. All six linked commands passed again with 24 reconciliation tests plus 8 CLI/packaging/flag checks. PR #160 holds final-head CI evidence and remains ready for review; full CI must rerun after this fix. Existing tracker-reconciliation items remain untouched. Package-level risk: legacy checkpoints need trustworthy version mapping before reversible application. SDK gap observed: timestamp-based restoration can select a later mutation sharing the same timestamp; no upstream issue was filed."
